\newlabel{tab:strong20m-best}{{4.4}{24}{Fastest full-node layout at each node count for the fixed 20M problems, with its median time per solve and its advantage over flat MPI at the same core count. Medians of three runs; the 32-node row has about 4.9 thousand unknowns per core}{table.4.4}{}}
